# Gmail SMTP Configuration for Website Inquiries
# Replace these with your actual Gmail credentials:

# 1. Your Gmail address that will send the notification emails
GMAIL_USER=your-email@gmail.com

# 2. Your Google 16-character App Password (NOT your regular Gmail login password!)
# How to create it:
#   Step 1: Go to https://myaccount.google.com/security
#   Step 2: Make sure "2-Step Verification" is ON
#   Step 3: Search for "App passwords" in the top search box
#   Step 4: Create a new app named "Website Inquiries"
#   Step 5: Paste the 16-character code here:
GMAIL_APP_PASSWORD=your-16-char-app-password

# 3. Destination email where you want to receive inquiries (defaults to GMAIL_USER if blank)
INQUIRY_RECIPIENT_EMAIL=your-email@gmail.com
